1
00:00:00,160 --> 00:00:02,280
Ridge line. Zero bars.

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,060
The cloud?

3
00:00:03,060 --> 00:00:04,720
GONE. And just like that,

4
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:06,840
your cloud AI goes dark.

5
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:08,160
But not this one!

6
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:09,500
This is Tahak —

7
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:12,620
an AI hiking guide that runs entirely

8
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:13,560
on your phone.

9
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:16,400
No signal, no server, no problem!

10
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,820
At home, you download the whole mountain:

11
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:21,780
the map, every Trail, every Waypoint,

12
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:22,920
every trail note.

13
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:24,920
Then airplane mode on.

14
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:25,680
Let's go!

15
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:27,780
On the Trail, it tracks you live:

16
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:29,840
where you are, the next Waypoint,

17
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:31,060
how far to the top.

18
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:32,299
Drift off the Trail?

19
00:00:32,299 --> 00:00:33,380
It catches you.

20
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:35,920
It buzzes and points you straight back.

21
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:36,980
Got a question?

22
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:38,000
Just ask.

23
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,500
English, Filipino or Taglish.

24
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:42,140
Malayo pa ba yung summit?

25
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:43,940
May tubig ba sa taas?

26
00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:46,340
A real AI model, right on the phone,

27
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:49,940
answering from THIS mountain's own notes.

28
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:51,700
Snakebite? It doesn't guess.

29
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:53,780
It opens the first-aid Guide,

30
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:54,800
step by step.

31
00:00:54,800 --> 00:00:55,840
Need to be found?

32
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:57,020
Fire the Flare!

33
00:00:57,020 --> 00:00:58,800
Light, strobe, whistle!

34
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:01,980
When the cloud disappears, Tahak keeps going.

35
00:01:01,980 --> 00:01:04,019
Tahak. When the signal drops,

36
00:01:04,019 --> 00:01:05,839
your guide doesn't!

